{
  "id": "unique-event-029",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#29 - The Good Doctor\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,22,44]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A gaunt figure in a doctor’s garb\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,44,78]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "stands before you. As he stretches\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,78,113]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "his bony fingers at you, you feel\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,113,147]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your skin crawl. At the corner of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,147,181]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your eyes, long shadows creep on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,181,214]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the green walls and move closer.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,214,247]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Choose one of the following:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,247,276]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● You  lose 1 Life for every Injury\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,276,312]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have and 1 Sanity for\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,312,338]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "every Mental Scar you have. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,338,369]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have no Injury or Mental\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,369,398]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Scar, gain 1 Mental Scar and 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,398,429]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Injury; the Good Doctor will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,429,458]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disappear as soon as you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,458,483]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "apply the damage; or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,483,504]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Lose any medical equipment\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,504,533]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(drugs or first aid kits) you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,533,563]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "carry; if you have no medical\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,563,593]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "equipment, take 4 damage\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,593,618]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "instead; the Good Doctor will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,618,648]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disappear as soon as you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,648,673]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sacrifice your medical\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,673,696]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "equipment or take damage; or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,696,725]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Fight the good doctor. He is a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,725,758]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "L6 unique Undead, 8 Life,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,758,784]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage 1. No weapon may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,784,808]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "inflict more than 1 damage to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,808,838]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "him. Your attacks against him\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,838,868]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "do not inflict additional\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,868,894]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage for exploding dice\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,894,920]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls. If you defeat him, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,920,950]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "gain 1 first aid kit and d6 doses\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,950,984]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of painkillers. In addition, if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,984,1016]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you are playing a mission that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1016,1047]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "requires to find prescription\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1047,1077]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "drugs, you immediately find a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1077,1107]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "dose of what you need. The\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1107,1134]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Good Doctor is a unique\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1134,1158]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creature. If you defeat him and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1158,1190]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "meet him again in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1190,1212]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "campaign, roll on the Unique\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1212,1241]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-029:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Zombie table instead.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1241,1263]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    90
  ]
}
